  "title": "Raspberry Jam without Pectin",
  "description": "Canning raspberry jam doesn’t get easier than this beginner-friendly, 3-ingredient recipe that skips the pectin and yields a huge batch of tasty jam.",
  "authors": [
    "Francine Lizotte Club Foody"
  ],
