  "ingredients": [
    "4 cups mashed raspberries",
    "4 cups white sugar",
    "1 tablespoon freshly squeezed lemon juice"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vZUlB4_ECB7Ov8YCy6umw1zDE7c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/263781-raspberry-jam-without-pectin-VAT-step-01-0446594805864687abe296cf78865eca.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/263781/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring raspberries to a boil in a very large pot. Cook for 4 minutes. Add sugar and lemon juice; stir well. Bring back to a boil, stirring constantly. Cook for another 4 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0CrGwKDXmy45euJXh7den1bOh3g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/263781-raspberry-jam-without-pectin-VAT-step-02-3759333e49324a6d946e79239e3294f3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/263781/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove pot from heat and divide jam into sterilized jars, leaving 1/4-inch of space at the top. Wipe the rims of the jars with a moist paper towel to remove any food residue. Top with lids, and screw on rings.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Z7ZotjG5WhhxbULShrOcg4S3cIE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/263781-raspberry-jam-without-pectin-VAT-step-03-6fd7fd7785aa40ac91ddb64233e5e2c0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/263781/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place a rack in the bottom of a large stockpot and fill halfway with water. Bring to a boil, then carefully lower the jars into the pot using a holder, leaving a 2-inch space between the jars. Pour in more boiling water if necessary until the water level is at least 1 inch above the tops of the jars. Bring the water to a full boil, cover the pot, and process for 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove the jars from the stockpot and let rest, several inches apart, for 8 hours. Store in a cool, dark area.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TVQ43btra1vVfEKzXOIANwO981g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/263781-raspberry-jam-without-pectin-VAT-step-05-2583db60147a4677925d43fce8e7ebea.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/263781/step_05.webp"
    }
  ],
